      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST OUTLAW.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneV_37.3/p@133365",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND OUTLAW.\nBeing nimble-footed, he hath outrun us.\nBut Moyses and Valerius follow him.\nGo thou with her to the west end of the wood;\nThere is our captain. We’ll follow him that’s fled.\nThe thicket is beset; he cannot ’scape.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneV_37.3/p@133365/line-1",
