      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST OUTLAW.\nCome, I must bring you to our captain’s cave.\nFear not; he bears an honourable mind\nAnd will not use a woman lawlessly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
